d  counseling but  rest sleep healthy diet reducing stress  are all vital to supporting the brain  and the body  for some it's enough to get back to  normal health  now gupta is in the midst now of a  randomized trial for long coveted  patients and hopes to have results  sometime later this year  meantime his program is available online  at guptapprogram.com  and you can read his clinical studies  and see testimonials of people worldwide  who have benefited from resetting their  brain
 

